OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,Fand dry on Saturday, then cloudier on
OL,7,FSunday and Monday with patchy rain and
OL,8,Fshowers. Feeling cold with
OL,9,Ftemperatures remaining below average.
